  Cell["This package/notebook does all basic calculations for a RICH \
detector.\nPrecision[x] gives a measure of the relative uncertainty in the \
value of x . With absolute uncertainty dx, Precision[x] is - Log[10, dx/x] \
.\nAccuracy[x] gives a measure of the absolute uncertainty in the value of x \
. With uncertainty dx, Accuracy[x] is - Log[10, dx] .", "Text", 
   InitializationCell -> True, CellChangeTimes -> {3.945862080410919*^9, 
     3.982754736755783*^9}, ExpressionUUID -> 
    "36952da5-1cd4-a54c-bf45-da418db4a163"], 
